#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:250
msgid "Requires a compatible Proton variant."
msgstr "Vyžaduje kompatibilní variantu Protonu."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:267
